# goat-flow is deliberately NOT ignored here: the .goat-flow/ pointers in
# CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md have to resolve for anyone who clones the repo.
# .goat-flow/.gitignore decides what is publishable and is default-deny, so
# session logs, plan contents, the scratchpad, the audit cache, and install
# state all stay local. Rules cannot be added here to override it: git gives a
# deeper .gitignore precedence over its parents. .goat-flow/hooks/ is therefore
# tracked and executable - review any pull request that touches it before
# checking the branch out, and see .github/CODEOWNERS.
